Z||000000||Haagster||10-05-2001||01:25 PM||||The Fall Carlisle show is in full swing this weekend.  As a result, traffic around town is impossible.  My trip between Carlisle and Harrisburg (usually 25 minutes) took an hour and half this morning...  shoulda gone the back way?!?  I did...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Anyway, the show looks to be a good time.  Parking is not available at the Armory lot so "other" arrangements have been made (mile or so away) and a free shuttle bus is running between the lot and the gate(s).  I wont be going myself til Sunday morning, but I am looking forward to the last show of the 2001 season...<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_8.jpg"> <BR>87GT||||reg||6
